sequenceDiagram
  participant Job as InvoiceReminderScheduler
  participant DB as "invoice_reminder table"
  participant Bus as "billing.events"
  participant Mail as ReminderMailListener
  Job->>+DB: selects due, unsent reminders
  DB-->>-Job: reminders
  Job->>Bus: publishes InvoiceReminderDue
  Bus->>+Mail: delivers via billing.invoice-reminder
  alt mail server refuses
    Mail-->>Bus: rejects, goes to billing.dlx
  else sent
    Mail->>-DB: marks the reminder sent
  end
